                        <String CONTENT="only mention the very popular tale about the orphan, which is known also"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l31" HPOS="393" VPOS="2248" WIDTH="984" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="395 2289 1377 2295" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="395 2289 393 2302 1373 2308 1377 2295 1375 2265 1268 2252 1266 2252 1190 2263 1165 2252 1163 2252 1161 2252 1159 2252 1136 2263 1110 2252 1108 2252 1106 2252 1104 2252 1067 2263 999 2250 997 2250 800 2261 703 2248 701 2248 699 2248 654 2261 619 2261 607 2250 607 2248 606 2248 604 2248 602 2248 600 2248 570 2259 395 2259 395 2289"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="among the Eskimo, Asiatic and American."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_3-100_r5" HPOS="396" VPOS="2348" WIDTH="1782" HEIGHT="665" TAGREFS="TYPE_2">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="396 2348 2178 2348 2178 3013 396 3013"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l32" HPOS="508" VPOS="2345" WIDTH="1659" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="508 2374 2167 2374" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="508 2374 508 2392 2167 2392 2167 2374 2165 2345 508 2347 508 2374"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“In a maritime village were many houses. A scabby orphan lived in the last rear house all"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l33" HPOS="393" VPOS="2392" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="395 2425 2163 2419" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="395 2425 395 2441 2161 2441 2163 2419 2157 2392 393 2396 395 2425"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="alone by himself. He found a lone old woman, always hungry, and said to her, ‘Be at least my"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l34" HPOS="397" VPOS="2443" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="46" BASELINE="397 2470 2165 2470" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2470 397 2489 2165 2484 2165 2470 2165 2443 397 2443 397 2470"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="grandmother.’ Then they lived together, all the time without food. Then the people killed a"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l35" HPOS="397" VPOS="2489" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="41" BASELINE="397 2515 2165 2515" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2515 397 2528 2163 2530 2165 2515 2165 2489 397 2489 397 2515"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="whale. The old woman said to the orphan, ‘Go and ask them for some meat “from under the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l36" HPOS="393" VPOS="2526" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="395 2565 2165 2562" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="395 2565 395 2577 2165 2573 2165 2562 2161 2534 411 2526 409 2526 407 2526 405 2526 393 2532 395 2565"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="flipper.” (The meat from under the flipper is considered to be of poor quality, tough to eat.) The"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l37" HPOS="395" VPOS="2579" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="397 2612 2161 2604" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2612 397 2630 2159 2626 2161 2604 2155 2579 395 2585 397 2612"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="people are coming back, all of them are carrying meat.’ He went to meet them. ‘What do you"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l38" HPOS="395" VPOS="2620" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="51" BASELINE="397 2657 2159 2653" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2657 397 2671 2157 2667 2159 2653 2155 2620 491 2620 489 2620 395 2630 397 2657"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="want?’ — ‘Grandmother says, “Ask them for some flipper.”’ — ‘Nay, ask from those who are behind.’"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l39" HPOS="395" VPOS="2665" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="52" BASELINE="397 2704 2161 2700" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="395 2696 397 2704 397 2716 2157 2717 2161 2700 2157 2675 1278 2665 1276 2665 1274 2665 1239 2675 409 2667 395 2696"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="He went on farther. ‘What do you want?’ — ‘Grandmother says, “Ask for some flipper.”’ Every"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l40" HPOS="395" VPOS="2712" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="397 2751 2161 2745" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2751 397 2768 2159 2768 2161 2745 2157 2719 1003 2712 1001 2712 951 2721 559 2714 557 2714 395 2723 397 2751"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="one repulsed him. Instead of giving him anything, they beat him. Then the Merciful Being took"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l41" HPOS="395" VPOS="2768" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="397 2797 2163 2793" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2797 397 2813 2161 2813 2163 2793 2157 2768 395 2770 397 2797"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="mercy on him, and the hindmost one gave him three small pieces of meat as large as a finger."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l42" HPOS="397" VPOS="2813" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="399 2844 2163 2840" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="399 2844 399 2860 2161 2860 2163 2840 2157 2813 397 2815 399 2844"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="These he put into three blubber-holes, and all were miraculously filled with meat. Then they felt"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l43" HPOS="397" VPOS="2860" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="46" BASELINE="399 2891 2163 2885" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="399 2891 399 2906 2161 2906 2163 2885 2157 2860 397 2860 399 2891"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="happy, and hurried to cook some meat in a kettle. The neighbors noticed the smoke. ‘Oh, what"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l44" HPOS="395" VPOS="2899" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="397 2938 2163 2932" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="397 2938 397 2951 904 2961 906 2961 1079 2951 2163 2951 2163 2932 2159 2899 986 2899 984 2899 982 2899 980 2899 964 2908 494 2901 493 2901 395 2910 397 2938"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="are the Scabby-Ones doing, cooking meat?’ They rushed into their house, took the meat out of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-100_l45" HPOS="397" VPOS="2944" WIDTH="550" HEIGHT="54" BASELINE="399 2983 947 2979" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="399 2983 399 2998 947 2994 947 2979 941 2944 397 2953 399 2983"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the kettle, and carried it out.”"/>
                    </TextLine>
